## Enemies - original 16-bit pixel art (all face RIGHT). Generated with a material spec: every sprite has a
## dark hue-tinted outline (slot 1) and 2-4 step shading ramps per material, light from the top-left.
## Notes for the engine:
##  - goomba.1 is symmetric except the feet: the walk mirrors it every 8 ticks; goomba.2 = goomba.1 mirrored.
##  - wing.1/wing.2 are the LEFT (back) wing (1 = up, 2 = down), root at the lower-right of the 8x8; mirror for a right wing.
##  - shell.1..4 / bshell.1..4: 1 = resting; spin cycle 1,2,3,4 (3 = opening facing the viewer).
##  - piranha/venus use palette `plant`: slots 2-5 red head, 6-8 white spots/lips, 9-12 lime stem/leaves, 13 mouth.
##  - podoboo is authored rising (flame trail below); the engine flips it vertically while it falls.
##  - koopa.green/koopa.red, bobomb/bobomb.flash, rotodisc/rotodisc.2 share slot layouts (swap freely).
##  - extra palettes: `micro`, `bobomb`, `bobomb.flash`, `rocky` (rocky.*, wrench.1), `lakitu` (lakitu, cloud.ride;
##    cloud = slots 2-5 so a 3-color fallback still reads), `cannonball`, `rotodisc`, `rotodisc.2` (flash frame).
pal goomba #2A1008 #F8B878 #D88040 #A85828 #703818 #FFE8C0 #F0C088 #C08850 #FFFFFF #C8C8E0 #905830 #603818
